<title>LATVIA: RIGA TRANSPORT FLEET 1996 PROFIT 182,719 LATS.</title>
<headline>RIGA TRANSPORT FLEET 1996 PROFIT 182,719 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riga Transport Fleet on Tuesday reported 1996 profit of 182,719 lats against 1995 profit of 172,418, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The company in 1996 saw net turnover of 11.44 million lats in 1996 versus 12.60 million lats the year before, a bourse official told Reuters.</p>
<p>RTF's balance sheet total in 1996 was 34.76 million lats againt 6.78 million lats in 1995.</p>
<p>Riga Transport Fleet is an active official list stock on the Riga bourse. It registered a price of 1.58 lats at reopening trade on Tuesday versus 1.61 lats the day before.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
